+# SC2 Fork
+
+This is a fork of SC2 containing all changes made to improve the [FC pregmod (nsfw)](https://gitgud.io/pregmodfan/fc-pregmod).
+
+Important branches:
+* `fc-rebase`: Reapplied changes for FC on SC 2.37.3. Based on `fc` and `fc-majou`
+* `master`: Current SC2 version
+* `fc-majou`: ARCHIVE - SC2 with our changes, based on [majou's modifications](https://gitgud.io/majou/sugarcube-2) - Replaced by `fc-rebased`
+* `fc`: ARCHIVE - SC2 with our changes - Replaced by `fc-majou`
+
+Warning: When cloning you will be on `master` initially. You want to checkout `fc-rebase` first before doing anything else.
+
+## Building
+1. `node build.js -n -b 2` to build release version
+2. replaces `/devTools/tweeGo/storyFormats/sugarcube-2/format.js` and `devNotes/sugarcube stuff/<current SC2 version>-format.js`
+3. `node build.js -n -b 2 -u -d` to build debug version
+4. replaces `devNotes/sugarcube stuff/<current SC2 version>-debug-format.js`
+
+If you believe to have found a bug, be sure to check if it was introduced with our changes before reporting them at the SC2 repo.
+
+## Contributing
+
+Check the [documentation](https://gitgud.io/pregmodfan/fc-pregmod/-/blob/pregmod-master/devNotes/sugarcube%20stuff/building%20SugarCube.md) at the FC repo.
+
+## SC2 README; most of it stays the same, but be sure to change the url when cloning:
+
 # SugarCube v2
 
 [SugarCube](http://www.motoslave.net/sugarcube/) is a free (gratis and libre) story format for [Twine/Twee](http://twinery.org/).
